{
  "rationale": "The plant is split into sensing and motion capability. The specifications encode a safe exploration policy with one-shot action states, obstacle-triggered recovery, rare backward escape only for front blockage, and a dedicated last-resort full rotation only after repeated front-blocked outcomes. Action states self-loop on path_clear so intended pulses are not preempted, while obstacle events can redirect to recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Use separate plant automata for sensor outcomes and motion commands so the supervisor composes perception with action constraints cleanly.",
    "Use small specification automata to bind clear sensing to forward progress, left/right obstacles to consistent directed turns, front obstacles to brief backward-then-turn recovery, and repeated front blockage to a dedicated full-rotate last resort."
  ],
